{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function providePacerOptions(host, options): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/lit-pacer/src/provider/PacerProvider.ts#L55","children":[{"type":"text","value":"provider/PacerProvider.ts:55"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Supplies reactive defaults for this host and its descendants, including across\nshadow roots. Call during construction, before creating utilities. The nearest\nprovider wins, and each utility's local options override provider defaults."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"host","children":[{"type":"text","value":"host"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReactiveControllerHost"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/LitPacerOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LitPacerOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/PacerProviderOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"PacerProviderOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"constructor() {\n  super()\n  providePacerOptions(this, () => ({\n    debouncer: { leading: this.leading },\n  }))\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"host","text":"host","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction providePacerOptions(host, options): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [provider/PacerProvider.ts:55](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/lit-pacer/src/provider/PacerProvider.ts#L55)\n\nSupplies reactive defaults for this host and its descendants, including across\nshadow roots. Call during construction, before creating utilities. The nearest\nprovider wins, and each utility's local options override provider defaults.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\n### options\n\n[`LitPacerOptions`](../type-aliases/LitPacerOptions.md)\\<[`PacerProviderOptions`](../interfaces/PacerProviderOptions.md)\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconstructor() {\n  super()\n  providePacerOptions(this, () => ({\n    debouncer: { leading: this.leading },\n  }))\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: providePacerOptions\ntitle: providePacerOptions\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction providePacerOptions(host, options): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [provider/PacerProvider.ts:55](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/lit-pacer/src/provider/PacerProvider.ts#L55)\n\nSupplies reactive defaults for this host and its descendants, including across\nshadow roots. Call during construction, before creating utilities. The nearest\nprovider wins, and each utility's local options override provider defaults.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\n### options\n\n[`LitPacerOptions`](../type-aliases/LitPacerOptions.md)\\<[`PacerProviderOptions`](../interfaces/PacerProviderOptions.md)\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconstructor() {\n  super()\n  providePacerOptions(this, () => ({\n    debouncer: { leading: this.leading },\n  }))\n}\n```\n"}
